        TubeToMP4 provides a free web-based tool that allows users to download videos from YouTube and other platforms for personal, non-commercial use only. The Service is provided free of charge and is supported by third-party advertising.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">4. Advertising</h2>
      <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Our Service displays advertisements provided by third-party advertising networks, including Google AdSense. By using our Service, you acknowledge and agree that:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-white/60 space-y-2 mb-4 list-disc pl-6">
        <li>Advertisements may be displayed on any page of the Service</li>
        <li>Third-party advertisers may use cookies and similar technologies to serve ads based on your interests</li>
        <li>We do not endorse or guarantee any products or services advertised on our site</li>
        <li>You will not engage in any activity to artificially inflate ad clicks or impressions</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">5. User Responsibilities</h2>
      <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        You are solely responsible for ensuring that your use of this Service complies with all applicable laws and regulations, including copyright laws. You agree not to use this Service to:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-white/60 space-y-2 mb-4 list-disc pl-6">
        <li>Download copyrighted content without proper authorization from the rights holder</li>
        <li>Redistribute, sell, or commercially exploit downloaded content</li>
        <li>Circumvent technological protection measures or DRM</li>
        <li>Violate any third-party rights, including intellectual property rights</li>
        <li>Use the Service for any illegal purpose or in violation of any laws</li>
        <li>Attempt to interfere with, compromise, or disrupt the Service</li>
        <li>Use automated systems, bots, or scripts to access the Service</li>
        <li>Collect or harvest any information from the Service or its users</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        The Service, including its original content, features, and functionality, is owned by TubeToMP4 and is protected by international copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws. Our trademarks, logos, and service marks may not be used without our prior written consent.
      </p>
      <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        We respect the intellectual property rights of others. If you believe that any content available through our Service infringes upon your copyright, please refer to our <a href="/dmca" class="text-brand-red hover:underline">DMCA Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">7. Disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="text-white/60 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        TubeToMP4 is an independent tool and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by YouTube, Google, Alphabet Inc., or any other platform. We do not host any copyrighted content on our servers. All videos are processed directly from the source platform.
